\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">obligation</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已指派责任人</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项义务的权重（建档类义务权重大于核对类），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示所有义务都有明确的责任主体。任何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的状态，都意味着某条义务在系统里&quot;无人认领&quot;——上线后必然表现为合规缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[识别产品品类] --&gt; B{是否有已生效授权法案?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| Z[暂不需 DPP&lt;br/&gt;保留通用义务]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{投放者是否欧盟境内?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[落制造商角色&lt;br/&gt;责任锚点 = 本主体]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[指定授权代表&lt;br/&gt;+ 确定进口商]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; F[按角色 × 义务矩阵&lt;br/&gt;指派每条义务]&#10;  F --&gt; G{覆盖度 C = 1?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[补齐无人认领义务]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[生成责任链 + 核对事件流]&#10;  H --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[识别产品品类] --&gt; B{是否有已生效授权法案?}\n  B --&gt;|否| Z[暂不需 DPP&lt;br/&gt;保留通用义务]\n  B --&gt;|是| C{投放者是否欧盟境内?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[落制造商角色&lt;br/&gt;责任锚点 = 本主体]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[指定授权代表&lt;br/&gt;+ 确定进口商]\n  E --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; F[按角色 × 义务矩阵&lt;br/&gt;指派每条义务]\n  F --&gt; G{覆盖度 C = 1?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[补齐无人认领义务]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[生成责任链 + 核对事件流]\n  H --&gt; F</pre><p>落库时，这张矩阵通常表现为三个实体：<code>actor</code>（角色实体，带 <code>role_type</code> 与法律主体信息）、<code>obligation</code>（义务项，带 <code>category</code> 与 <code>weight</code>）、<code>responsibility</code>（关联表，把义务指派到具体 actor 并记录生效时间）。<strong>责任锚点</strong>则体现为 DPP 主记录上的一个强制外键，指向被法律认定为制造商的那个 actor——它不随技术托管、跨境履约或平台代运营而改变。当你的 DPP 系统能对任意一件商品回答&quot;谁是它的法定制造商、每条义务由谁承担、谁在何时核对过哪个版本&quot;，这套义务分配模型才算真正落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>义务挂在角色上，不挂在所有权上</strong>：ESPR 用经济运营者角色分配 DPP 义务，行为（投放市场/投入使用）触发角色。</li>\n<li><strong>制造商是唯一原点</strong>：建档、唯一标识、数据托管、注册表登记都由制造商承担，且<strong>不可通过外包转移法律责任</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>非欧盟制造商必须补法律落点</strong>：指定授权代表是跨境场景的强制环节。</li>\n<li><strong>进口商可能被视同制造商</strong>：以自己名义投放或实质修改产品时，责任升级。</li>\n<li><strong>下游是核对与止损</strong>：分销商、经销商、履约服务商、在线市场各守一段，必须留下核对事件流。</li>\n<li><strong>系统落地 = 角色×义务矩阵 + 责任锚点</strong>：用覆盖度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 检查是否有义务无人认领。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>角色划分的前置问题是&quot;这件产品到底受不受 ESPR 约束&quot;，那属于适用性判定，见同章 <a href=\"espr-dpp-legal-framework-scope\">ESPR 法规框架与 DPP 适用产品范围界定</a>；数据字段如何随角色落库、载体如何选型，则留待后续章节展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经济运营者角色划分与 DPP 义务分配模型","id":"经济运营者角色划分与-dpp-义务分配模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：经济运营者是角色集合，而非单一身份","id":"核心概念-经济运营者是角色集合-而非单一身份"},{"level":2,"text":"制造商：DPP 义务的原点与信息持有者","id":"制造商-dpp-义务的原点与信息持有者"},{"level":2,"text":"进口商与分销商：核对义务与可追溯链的守住","id":"进口商与分销商-核对义务与可追溯链的守住"},{"level":2,"text":"履约服务提供者与在线市场：跨境电商的特有角色","id":"履约服务提供者与在线市场-跨境电商的特有角色"},{"level":2,"text":"义务分配的工程模型：角色 × 义务矩阵与责任锚点","id":"义务分配的工程模型-角色-义务矩阵与责任锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ESPR 法规框架与 DPP 适用产品范围界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/digital-product-passport-espr-compliance/dpp-regime-legal-model/espr-dpp-legal-framework-scope"},"next":{"title":"唯一产品标识（UPI）与产品注册表数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/digital-product-passport-espr-compliance/dpp-regime-legal-model/unique-product-identifier-registry-model"}}